  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nWhen trying to accept an invite, the worker instead instantly returns with a \"No Known Servers\" error. If I instead redirect the join to the main synapse process it goes through.\r\n\r\nThe setup is Synapse 0.29.0 with a sync and event sender worker.\r\n\r\nConfig for the worker is:\r\n```\r\nworker_app: synapse.app.event_creator\r\nserver_name: half-shot.uk\r\nreport_stats: False\r\n\r\n# The replication listener on the synapse to talk to.\r\nworker_replication_host: 127.0.0.1\r\nworker_replication_port: 9592\r\nworker_replication_http_port: 9593\r\n\r\nworker_listeners:\r\n - type: http\r\n   port: 8020\r\n   resources:\r\n     - names:\r\n       - client\r\n\r\nworker_daemonize: False\r\nworker_pid_file: /var/run/synapse/event_creator.pid\r\nworker_log_config: /etc/matrix-synapse/workers.conf.d/event_creator.log.cfg\r\n```",
